# =========================================================
# quickslogx HRMS - Environment Variables Configuration
# =========================================================

# 1. OPTIONAL: MongoDB Atlas Connection (for full MongoDB persistence)
# MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://<username>:<password>@cluster0.mongodb.net/quickslogx_hrms?retryWrites=true&w=majority

# 2. OPTIONAL: Supabase Connection (for Postgres & Realtime subscriptions)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOi...

# 3. Vercel System Deployment
# When deploying to Vercel:
# - No required environment variables are mandated for basic preview/demo mode.
# - The system automatically falls back to universal persistent storage with rich seed data.
# - To connect your real production MongoDB or Supabase, add the respective keys above in the Vercel Project Settings!
